		line-height: 1.2;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		color: var(--accent2);
	}

	.brand-subtitle {
		margin-top: 10px;
		font-size: 13px;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		color: var(--muted);
	}

